Inherited notice

Most Rocq modules of theories/ derive from the private repository
LLM4Rocq/ellipsoid_rocq. Commit 29df54e of this repository copied them
from commit 9556cdd of LLM4Rocq/ellipsoid_rocq, with the logical root
Tablet renamed EllipsoidFitting. Parts of
extension/Model/Measurability.v reuse proofs of two of these modules,
theories/Measurability/Fit.v and theories/Measurability/Conditioned.v.
Some statement snapshots under check/snapshots/, such as
SnapshotPhase1.txt, print declarations of these modules. The license
notice of LLM4Rocq/ellipsoid_rocq is the same MIT license text, with
the same copyright line, "Copyright (c) 2026 LLM4Rocq". LICENSE
reproduces it unchanged.


The OpenAI math collection

The files of applications/ and some files of library/ formalize
arguments from manuscripts of the OpenAI math collection (openai/math at
revision 1581d4cbd, under the Apache License 2.0). Their comments name
the manuscripts, and the Lean declarations of the collection, whose
arguments they follow. No Lean code of the collection is copied into
them.
